0, "image": "engenn4le17ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": ""}, {"time": "10", "id": 1, "image": "engenn4le17ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey, John! So, where are you now? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Hi, Peter! We just left Argentina. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Where's that? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: It's about 5,000 miles from where you are! Argentina is a coastal South American country.<br>"}, {"time": "16000", "id": 2, "image": "engenn4le17ob11re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Did you see any penguins? There are large colonies there! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Wow! How did you know?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I like to watch wildlife videos. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Me too! When you learn about the local wildlife, you enjoy your trip so much more, eh?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's right! Did you take your field glasses? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: No, but the tourists had theirs. Tigre was peaceful - there were so many birds!<br>"}, {"time": "43000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn4le17ob11re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How far is Tigre from Buenos Aires? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: It's about 20 miles from there. What's new with the gang?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Vanessa is looking for a job. Sally is in Russia, I think.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Really? How interesting! <br>"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le17ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le17ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn4le17ob11re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le17ob11re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "John in Argentina", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Heading Home ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about directions to places in  a limited range of social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Zero Conditional", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the zero conditional to talk about general truths and certainties and to give instructions. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "There are two parts to the sentence.  <br><br>One part is the <span class=\"strong\">condition</span>. The other part is the <span class=\"strong\">result</span>. When you want to give an instruction, use the imperative in the main clause. <br><br>Form:<br>If  or When + subject + the Simple Present Tense/Imperative<br>You can flip the two parts of the sentence so that the result comes first.<br>Subject + The Simple Present tense/Imperative + if or when + subject + the Simple Present", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">When you learn about the local wildlife,</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">you enjoy your trip so much more.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Notice that you only need a comma (,) if you say the condition first. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You enjoy your trip so much more</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">when you learn about the local wildlife.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Geographic Features", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Geographical features, are natural things like bodies of water, plants, animals, and how the land looks. In Argentina the geographic features include:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">NATURE</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le17ob11img01.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a stream\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le17ob11img02.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a river\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le17ob11img03.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"an island\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le17ob11img04.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a forest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le17ob11img05.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a lake\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br><span class=\\\"strong\\\">ANIMALS</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le17ob11img06.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a moose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le17ob11img07.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a panther\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le17ob11img08.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cardinals\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le17ob11img09.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a nest with eggs\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "coastal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "talking about the area next to the ocean", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Their main breeding ground is coastal Argentina.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "colony", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large number of animals", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can see large colonies of penguins.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "penguin", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a bird that lives in cold climates and cannot fly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I saw in my guidebook that there are penguins in Argentina!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "wildlife", "type": "name"}, {"content": "wild animals", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Be sure to keep an eye out for wildlife.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "field glasses", "type": "name"}, {"content": "binoculars for outdoor use", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't forget to bring your field glasses.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "peaceful", "type": "name"}, {"content": "calm and quiet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is peaceful enough for the birds to breed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write an 8 - 10 line dialogue between you and a friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe what is new with you and \u201cthe gang\u201d.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the dialogue with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles and practice again.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about what is current in my life with my friends.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a dialogue about my social life.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice speaking in a dialogue.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}